# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data
#
# PRIVATE source (real comment text + real usernames) is NEVER committed:
data/raw/
data/derived/
#
# PUBLIC release IS committed: data/public/ holds only
# anonymized, text-free derivatives , the anonymized corpus (pseudonym authors,
# no text), the dehydrated id+label CSV, and PII-free validation artifacts
# (panel labels, populations, human labels, and an anonymized validation key
# that drops orig_id/author). Regenerate with build_public_data.py.
# See data/README.md and DATA_RELEASE.md.
